<%- include('partials/head') %>
<main id="main">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="shell hero-inner">
      <p class="eyebrow">Studio operations</p>
      <h1 class="hero-title">Every commission, tesserae count and sheet of smalti in one place.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">
        Mosaic Tile Studio Orders turns a mural palette into sheets of smalti and vitreous glass, keeps the
        glass room honest to the sheet, and shows which stage each commission has reached in the workshop.
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/login">Sign in to the studio</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/signup">Create a studio account</a>
      </div>
      <p class="demo-cred">Demo: cenius@cenius.ai / cenius</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="shell home-grid" aria-label="What the studio tool covers">
    <article class="panel panel--raise">
      <h2 class="chip-label">Palette maths</h2>
      <p class="panel-body">
        Break a mural into colour lines and turn tesserae into sheets — 225 per smalti sheet, 400 per vitreous —
        with palette totals you can quote from.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="panel panel--raise">
      <h2 class="chip-label">Glass room</h2>
      <p class="panel-body">
        Smalti and vitreous lots counted in sheets, reserved against a palette in one all-or-nothing action, and
        flagged the moment a lot reaches its low-stock threshold.
      </p>
    </article>
    <article class="panel panel--raise">
      <h2 class="chip-label">Grouting &amp; fixing</h2>
      <p class="panel-body">
        Design &amp; cartoon, tesserae cutting, gluing, grouting, fixing — every commission carries its own
        stage timeline, timestamps and workshop notes.
      </p>
    </article>
  </section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/foot') %>
